    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d383">

                <pb facs="0546" n="504" sameAs="frus:frus1863p1/pg504"/>

                <head>Lord Lyons to Mr. Seward.</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>,</placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-02-06"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >February</hi> 6, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have this afternoon had the honor to
                    receive your note of yesterday’s date respecting the blockade of the port of
                    Galveston, in Texas.</p>
                <p>In acknowledging the receipt of your communication, I take the opportunity of
                    repeating to you the assurance of the high consideration with which I am, sir,
                    your most obedient, humble servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>LYONS.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward</hi>, <hi
                            rendition="#italic">Secretary of State.</hi></p>
                </postscript>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
